Summary for chunk 1:
Madrid is the official tourism website for Madrid, Spain. It provides information on neighborhoods, things to do, art and culture, food and drink, shopping, nightlife, flamenco, parks and gardens, amusement parks and zoos, day trips, exhibitions, theater, dance, music, sports, special events, conferences, and trade shows. The website also includes a Madrid Events Calendar, an AI assistant for planning your trip, maps and guides, and official products such as the Madrid City Card and Official Madrid Shop.
